sequenceDiagram
  actor M as Specialist
  participant API as QuestionTemplatesService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  M->>API: POST /question-templates {subSkillId, name}
  API->>DB: template + version 1 (draft, empty)
  M->>API: PUT /question-templates/:id/draft {content}
  API->>DB: update the single draft (partial unique: one draft per template)
  M->>API: POST /question-templates/:id/publish
  API->>API: assertVersionComplete (all fields, scores per option)
  alt incomplete
    API-->>M: 422 missing fields
  else no draft / already published
    API-->>M: 409
  else ok
    API->>DB: draft -> published (publishedBy, publishedAt)
    API-->>M: 200 new published version
  end
  Note over API,DB: New AI stories use the latest published version, old answers keep their snapshot
